    "teach_5": {
      "id": "teach_5",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Four parts may look unrelated until the question says their transformed values are equal.\n\nSuppose:\nfirst+3 = second−3 = 3×third = fourth/3 = k",
